## Provenance Notes by Release

v2.7.0 (Spiral Citadel) — Bitcoin chain-identity release
  - The BIP-110 / RDTS chain-split remediation that this release is named for
    is original to this repository, not ported: the daemon pinning and checksum
    gates, the stratum chain gate (internal/daemon/chainguard.go), the Sentinel
    chain_identity alert, the dashboard verdict row, and the coin-upgrade.sh
    reconsiderblock repair path.
  - Upstream work DOES ship in this release: Kamakhu's MinerClassS19, adopted
    from that fork during this cycle and credited in full above. Verified
    against the shipping code: InitialDiff 24000 / MinDiff 16384 /
    MaxDiff 65536 in spiralrouter.go, and classifyDevice() routing
    "antminer s19" in devicehints.go.
  - The adopted commit was reviewed for personal or health information before
    merge; none was present in the code that was taken.

